# Testing Strategy

## Unit Tests
- Uses Turbo for running tests (`yarn test`)
- Vitest only used for bitcoin-specific tests (`yarn test:bitcoin`)
- Happy-dom environment for DOM simulation where needed
- Focus on schema validation and utility function testing

## Component Tests
- Storybook Test Runner for UI components (`yarn test-storybook`)
- Stories serve dual purpose as documentation and tests
- Interaction testing through Storybook
- MSW for API mocking in stories
- Automated test helpers for consistent testing patterns

## Integration Tests
- API route testing with next-test-api-route-handler
- Mock service worker for API simulation
- Specific test setups for different chain interactions
- Comprehensive blockchain integration testing

## Test File Organization
- Tests colocated with source files
- Shared test helpers in tests/helpers
- Mock data patterns in mocks/ directory
- Storybook stories alongside components

